      "questionHtml": "Read the following statements and evaluate the conclusions based on traditional syllogistic logic.<br />\nStatements: All planets are stars.<br />\nSome stars are moons.<br />\nConclusions: I. Some planets are moons.<br />\nII. All moons being stars is a possibility.",
